schemaVersion: 1
id: stock-opportunities-reminder-root
name: Stock Opportunities Reminder
kind: root
version: 0.1.0
description: A stock scout that works for you. On the days you choose it looks for stocks worth a look, says where a buyer would buy and where the idea is wrong, and keeps score of its own opportunities.
entry: index.md
domain: Finance

# The app this cabinet opens on. Older Cabinets open on index.md.
app: app

# Things to try in this cabinet: at most 16, each at most 80 characters.
prompts:
  - text: "Is there anything worth a look today?"
  - text: "Explain your newest opportunity to me like I have never read a chart."
  - text: "Look at NVDA for me. Is it an opportunity or should I wait?"
  - text: "What is the market doing, and is it a good time to buy anything?"
  - text: "How did your opportunities do so far? Be honest."
  - text: "Why did you pass on the stocks you passed on?"
  - text: "What would make you change your mind on your last opportunity?"
  - text: "How do I work out how many shares to buy without risking too much?"
